      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NATALIE KEEPING (5) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and three placings from 12 starts. Recorded a 1.3 lengths win (21.92) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. QUEEN KIMETTO (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.17) at this track behind Page One News in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Can measure up. LITTLE DITZY (8) was chasing the leaders from a low draw and kept coming to score (15.95) at this track in Free For All over 275m. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Likely to be in the finish. INCREDIBLE HEART (2) should be in the finish fresh from a month break.",
